## COMMANDS REFERENCE

### Daily Use
```bash
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb verify           # Build + unit tests (DEFAULT)
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb verify --ui      # Build + unit + functional UI tests (excludes visual tests)
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb verify --clean   # Full clean build + unit tests
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb logs --follow    # Live log stream
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb logs --tail 100  # Last 100 lines
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb doctor           # Health check (environment, assets, permissions)
```

### Debugging
```bash
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb test_mode        # Interactive debug (kill→screenshots→crashes→build→launch→logs)
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb tm               # Shorthand for test_mode
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb diagnose --dump  # Dump runtime logs
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb crashes          # Analyze crash patterns
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb clean --nuclear  # Full clean (fixes phantom errors)
```

### API Verification (CRITICAL — prevents hallucinations)
```bash
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb verify_api <APIName> [Framework]
# Example: ./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb verify_api faceCaptureQuality Vision
```

### Testing
```bash
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb gen_test <name> --target <Component>  # Generate unit test
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb gen_test <name> --type ui             # Generate UI test
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb gen_test <name> --async               # Generate async test
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb validate_test_references              # Verify UI test references match code
bundle exec fastlane coverage                                  # Generate code coverage report
```

### Static Analysis
```bash
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb lint              # Code style and quality
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb check_deprecations # Find deprecated API usage
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb dead_code         # Find unused code (Periphery)
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb verify_mocks      # Check mocks match protocols
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb check_docs        # Verify docs match tool capabilities
```

### Validation Suites
```bash
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb test_suite --quick  # Fast: build, lint, test refs, xcodegen
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb test_suite --full   # All checks including dead code, deprecations
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb test_suite --ci     # CI-optimized
bundle exec fastlane verify_full            # Full CI verification (before pushing)
```

### Project Setup
```bash
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb setup    # Initial setup (dependencies, environment)
xcodegen generate                # Regenerate Xcode project (after new files)
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb gen_assets  # Generate test assets
./Scripts/SaneMaster.rb gen_mock    # Generate mocks (Mockolo)
```

### Ruby Power Tools
```bash
bundle exec lefthook run pre-commit  # Run pre-commit hooks manually
bundle exec fastlane verify          # Unit tests only (fast)
bundle exec fastlane release         # Full release preparation
bundle exec pry                      # Interactive Ruby REPL
bundle exec rubocop                  # Script linting
bundle exec bundle-audit             # Security audit
```

