## TESTING STRATEGY

### Test Tiers

| Tier | Target | Scope | Speed | Command |
|------|--------|-------|-------|---------|
| Unit | `SaneVideoTests` | Isolated logic, no I/O | <1s | `verify` |
| Integration/UI | `SaneVideoUITests` | End-to-end flows, real assets | 10-60s | `verify --ui` |
| Visual | Manual only | UI appearance verification | N/A | Manual inspection |
| Performance | `testExportPerformance` | Export speed, memory | Varies | Before releases |

### Visual Tests (Excluded from automated runs)
- `SaneSmartFeaturesVisualTests`
- `VisualEditingTests`
- `VisualRecordingTests`

These require manual visual inspection.

### TestEnvironment Helpers
- `TestEnvironment.isTesting` — Check if running in unit test context
- `TestEnvironment.isUITesting` — Check if running in UI test context
- Use these to mock permissions, bypass dialogs, and isolate tests

### Regression Testing
- **Location**: `SaneVideoTests/Regression/`
- **When to add**: Every bug fix (MANDATORY — Golden Rule #5)
- **Naming**: Descriptive names referencing the bug (e.g., `testSourceSwitchTimestampGap`)
- **Separation**: Do NOT mix with feature tests

### Code Coverage
```bash
bundle exec fastlane coverage        # Generate report
open fastlane/coverage/index.html    # View report
```

---

## MCP SERVERS & PLUGINS

### Active MCP Servers (`.mcp.json`)

| Server | Purpose | Use Case |
|--------|---------|----------|
| **apple-docs** | Apple Developer Documentation & WWDC transcripts (1,260+ sessions) | API examples, related APIs, understanding "why" behind APIs |
| **context7** | Real-time library documentation | Up-to-date docs for WhisperKit, Vapor, any library |
| **github** | GitHub API integration (Official MCP) | Issues, PRs, repos, code search |
| **memory** | Persistent knowledge graph (Official MCP) | Cross-session context retention |
| **TestSprite** | Automated test generation | Generate test plans, analyze coverage |
| **XcodeBuildMCP** | Programmatic Xcode builds | CI/CD integration, test runs, signing |

### Plugins

| Plugin | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| **swift-lsp** | Swift code intelligence (completion, go-to-definition, diagnostics) |

### When to Use Each Tool (Decision Matrix)

| Situation | Tool | Why |
|-----------|------|-----|
| **API signature/existence** | `verify_api` | SDK is source of truth (Rule #6) |
| **API examples/WWDC context** | `apple-docs` MCP | Rich examples, related APIs |
| **Build/test the project** | `SaneMaster.rb verify` | Always use SaneMaster (Rule #1) |
| **CI/CD programmatic builds** | `XcodeBuildMCP` | Granular control, automation |
| **Generate mock classes** | `gen_mock` (Mockolo) | Fast protocol→mock generation |
| **Generate test templates** | `gen_test` | Creates structured unit/UI tests |
| **iOS companion app testing** | `TestSprite` | AI-powered SwiftUI test gen |
| **GitHub issues/PRs** | `github` MCP | Create issues, review PRs |
| **Cross-session context** | `memory` MCP | Persistent knowledge graph |
| **Code intelligence** | `swift-lsp` plugin | Completions, go-to-definition |

### Future: iOS/iPadOS Companion Apps

- **TestSprite** = Primary UI testing tool for iOS
- **XcodeBuildMCP** = Target iOS simulators/devices
- Shared code in Swift Package for cross-platform
- Use `apple-docs` for UIKit vs AppKit differences
